msgid ""
"A piece of canvas stretched over a stick.  Used to catch bugs or fish, but "
"might not be as useful for the mutated ones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
msgid "gun cable lock"
msgid_plural "gun cable locks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of "gun cable lock"
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
msgid ""
"A set with a key and a small lock, resembling a padlock if the shackle was "
"replaced by a steel cable.  This design allows the cable to fit into the "
"chamber of a firearm and lock, preventing the firearm from functioning.  An "
"import part of gun safety, it is required by law to be sold with any firearm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ethanol"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"Extremely pure alcohol suitable for use as a component in chemical reactions."
"  You could also water it down and drink it, or use it as fuel in an alcohol-"
"burning stove."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "denatured alcohol"
msgid_plural "denatured alcohol"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of "methanol"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"High-purity methanol suitable for use in chemical reactions.  Could also be "
"used as fuel in an alcohol-burning stove.  Very toxic."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "diesel"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"A petroleum-based fuel made from a byproduct of the gasoline making process."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gasoline"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"A highly flammable liquid fuel.  When under pressure, it has the potential "
"for violent explosion."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "crude oil"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"A thick black slurry that can be refined to produce usable products including"
" gasoline or diesel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "napalm"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"Gasoline mixed with some other components to make it stick to surfaces and "
"increase burning temperature, meant to be used as flamethrower fuel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gelled gasoline"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"A flammable gel composed of gasoline and dissolved shavings of polystyrene, "
"roughly similar in properties to napalm B.  It's meant to be used as "
"flamethrower fuel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "biogas"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"Biogas gathered from anaerobic digester system, can be used in biogas cooker."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "turpentine"
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "Oil of turpentine, distilled from pine resin or crude oil."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "camphine"
msgid_plural "camphine"
msgstr[0] ""
